------------------------------------------------------------
--- TEE_AEUpdateAAD
------------------------------------------------------------

--- The 'TEE_AEUpdateAAD' function feeds a new chunk of Additional Authentication Data (AAD) to the AE operation.
--- See page 219 of the G.P. documentation for more details.

  msg reqAEUpdateAAD : HandleId List{Data} TaInstId -> Msg .
  msg finishTopAEUpdateAAD : HandleId TaInstId -> Msg .
  msg finishAEUpdateAAD : TaInstId -> Msg .

  rl [ae-update-aad-subroutine] :
